WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.300
- My beloved Yale family,
wherever you might be,

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.253
I invite you to join me
in the spirit of prayer.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.840
Almighty and loving
Creator, you are the force

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.610
that lights the stars, the
architect of every cell,

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.353
the source of all truth.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.910
We look to you as many expressions

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:32.363
of one living mystery, a
mystery beyond all telling.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.690
In this moment, we are people grieving

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.650
many different types of losses

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.120
and our hearts beat with
the rhythm of lament

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.874
as we cope with emotions too complex

00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:48.893
for any of us to fully understand.

00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:53.660
We who share this beautiful,
but aching, world,

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.190
we who look at the same
sun, and the same moon,

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.833
are a people called to
communal restoration.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:06.230
As students of your
handiwork, we gathered at Yale

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.940
from throughout the earth
with exquisite ambitions

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:12.470
and have been blessed
at this place of light

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.653
and truth with the
freedom to let them grow.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.398
Our God of all generations,
you are the guardian

00:01:20.398 --> 00:01:24.344
of where we are going
and who we are becoming.

00:01:24.344 --> 00:01:27.810
We are filled with
gratitude for our families,

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.770
friends, teachers, and guides.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.090
Their arms have sheltered us,

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.740
their shoulders have boosted us,

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:40.363
and today their hearts
are holding fast to us.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:45.030
Bless us as we seek to reimagine a world

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:47.840
made better by the considerable gifts

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.650
we will now bring to it.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:55.500
May we exude an intelligence
that is inspired by justice,

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:59.810
guided by tenderness, moved by holiness,

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.803
and always informed by love.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:08.920
As we greet tomorrow,
steady us on solid ground

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.700
and together may we become vibrant,

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:17.700
living examples of shalom, of
salaam, of shanti, of peace.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.423
For this we say, amen.

